 "notes": "Last page of Table XV Part I (concld.). 'Others' (cols 299-301) has no group header; its 'Details of others' column gives Males+Females for the province (ASSAM) for each minor language, recorded here as ASSAM records with persons null, lang_path ['Others', <group as printed>], cols []. Others, ASSAM Males: italic figure reads 1,210 (italic 2; 1,844 - 634 = 1,210 and 1,041 + 36 + 133 = 1,210). Others, (1) British Territory Persons italic reads 1,629 (sum of divisions and tracts). DISCREPANCY: the Details of others males add to 1,310, not the printed 1,210 total (females add to 634, which matches); kept as printed. Details: Khambu females first digit and Persian females first digit are partly broken (read 24 and 53; female details then total exactly 634). Sindhi males second digit is broken and could be 6 or 8: recorded '?'."
